flowchart TD
  A[Load current application manual data] --> B[Load current document and aligned extraction]
  B --> C[Resolve account-owned student number]
  C --> D[Latest exact reference version or missing or ambiguous]
  D --> E[Normalize fields without fuzzy identity matching]
  E --> F{Student field?}
  F -->|Yes| G[Compare A-B A-C and B-C]
  F -->|No| H[Compare A-B only; C not applicable]
  G --> I[Keep every source state and issue]
  H --> I
  I --> J[Snapshot bound to form document extraction and reference hashes]
  J --> K{Fingerprint equals current sources?}
  K -->|No| Stale[STALE; block approval]
  K -->|Yes| L{All reliable or justified admin review?}
  L -->|No| Review[Manual review required; no fake MATCH]
  L -->|Yes| M[Existing validation and signature checks still apply]
  Review --> N[Admin records reason and confirms exact fingerprint]
  N --> M
  M --> O[Recheck inside approval transaction]
  O --> P{Concurrent source change?}
  P -->|Yes| Stale
  P -->|No| Q[Commit only valid status transition]
